Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.14,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:08.81,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always stand up! Raise our unyielding flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.36,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,So many obstacles are already behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:17.77,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward! Hands up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:30.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,"I'm almost there, just a little further and I'll have the answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.49,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,558)}Translation\N{\fs40}bobthemilkman @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(756,366)}Translation check\N{\fs40}Lord Starfish @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:38.45,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed as I sailed into this new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.37,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(92,414)}Initial timing\N{\fs40}FAbian101 @ Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.43,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(808,476)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:45.98,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,That's right, the pieces of our dreams are joined together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:43.71,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190,296)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.96,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,488)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}MaideV and Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:54.03,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We're connected by unwavering bonds, let's head for a bright future!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:48.25,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844,384)}Raw providing\N{\fs40}OPC-Raws
