Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:20.50,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:24.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:31.13,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.16,0:01:35.36,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:39.63,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:48.29,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:51.92,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:54.84,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:59.75,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
